%% Title: MediSearch API Communication Flow
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor User as Patient / Pharmacy / Admin
  participant Web as Angular Frontend
  participant Guard as Route Guard / Interceptor
  participant API as Express REST API
  participant Auth as JWT Auth Middleware
  participant Service as Domain Service
  participant DB as Neon PostgreSQL
  participant AI as Recommendation Service

  User->>Web: Use MediSearch feature
  Web->>Guard: Resolve route and attach credentials
  Guard->>API: HTTPS REST request with JWT/cookie
  API->>Auth: Validate identity and role
  Auth-->>API: Authorized request context
  API->>Service: Execute use case
  alt Transactional data required
    Service->>DB: Query users, drugs, inventory, favorites
    DB-->>Service: Domain data
  end
  alt Recommendation or alternatives required
    Service->>AI: Request similarity or recommendation output
    AI-->>Service: Ranked drugs / alternatives
  end
  Service-->>API: Response DTO
  API-->>Web: JSON response and status code
  Web-->>User: Render result, dashboard, or notification
